# Outlaw Stitcher: "Plot {4}{U}", and the counters count only "this turn". On turn 1 Bot1 casts Mox Sapphire, Mox Jet and Black Lotus (three
# spells) and plots the Stitcher with them: plotting is a special action, no spell cast. On turn 3 the Stitcher is cast from exile as
# the first spell of that turn, so there is no spell other than the first: the Zombie Rogue stays a 2/2, whatever was cast on turn 1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Outlaw Stitcher
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Outlaw Stitcher.Activate(Ability: Plot)
! Bot1.Exile.Outlaw Stitcher.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Exile.Outlaw Stitcher.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Zombie Rogue Token.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Zombie Rogue Token.Toughness = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Zombie Rogue Token.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Outlaw Stitcher.Power = 1
